          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148067,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonların, oyuncu adı ve başlangıç puanı gibi iki veya daha fazla veri parçasıyla çalışmak için <strong>birden fazla parametreye</strong> ihtiyacı vardır.</p><p>Oyun ekranında iki parametre alan ve bunları görüntüleyen bir fonksiyon görmek için bir oyuncu adı ve skor gir.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0b1020;&#xA;    color: #e7eefc;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 18px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;    cursor: pointer;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    padding: 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;    border: 1px solid #334;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #hudList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    width: 280px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    padding: 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   .panel {&#xA;    width: 320px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    padding: 12px;&#xA;    border: 1px solid #223;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Game HUD Setup&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;hudInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;playerNameInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Player name&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;scoreInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Starting score&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;addHudLine()&quot;&gt;Add to HUD&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;HUD Messages&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=&quot;hudList&quot;&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let number = 0;&#xA;   &#xA;   function addHudLine() {&#xA;    if (number &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;HUD message limit reached&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const playerName = document.getElementById(&quot;playerNameInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     const score = document.getElementById(&quot;scoreInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     let node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Spawned: &quot; + playerName + &quot; | Score: &quot; + score);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;hudList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     number++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148068,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>showScore(points)</code> gibi tek bir parametreye sahip bir fonksiyon oluşturmayı öğrendik.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>showScore</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>points</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148069,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyona daha fazla parametre eklemek için <strong>virgül</strong> ve sonraki parametrenin adını ekleriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points, playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>playerName</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148070,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona birden fazla değer geçirmek de aynı şekilde çalışır; ikinci değerin ardından bir virgül <code>,</code> ekleriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points, playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Riley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>\"Riley\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148071,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci bir değer geçirdikten sonra yeni parametreyi fonksiyonumuzda kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Fonksiyonun içine <code>+ playerName</code> ekleyerek ikinci parametreyi görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points, playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points + \" /><text value=\"&quot; pts - &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Riley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>+</code>, ardından <code>playerName</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148072,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerler, bir fonksiyona parametrelerin bulunduğu <strong>aynı sırayla</strong> aktarılır. Bu örnekte ilk değer olarak <code>\"Wizard\"</code> ifadesini aktar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"chooseCharacters\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player 1: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player 2: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"chooseCharacters(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Wizard\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Knight\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametreleri virgüllerle ayırdığımız sürece istediğimiz kadar parametre ekleyebiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setLoadout\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"slot1, slot2, slot3\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slot1 + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + slot2 + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + slot3);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setLoadout(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>slot3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
